// BANK1_SOLO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2000750988" "<shout>This is my chance to prove myself to Silver Mantis and Lord Recluse."
// BANK1_SOLO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3343362929" "<shout>Hurry up! I ain't got all day!"
// BANK1_SOLO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2017971323" "<shout>Yes! Let your greed burn inside you!"

