// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Sig_Villain1 Var Name - SIG_VILLAIN1_VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Sig_Villain1 Var Name - SIG_VILLAIN1_BOSS_CRITTER 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Sig_Villain1 Var Name - SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1054029043" "<shout>Your 'Center' said there would be heroes to kill. I'm getting bored. "
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P483707474" "<shout>Captain Mako will not be pleased with this operation if {HeroName} doesn't show."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1306253788" "<shout>*sigh*. Looks like {HeroName} is a no-show. Well, hurry up and get the money, then."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1007955607" "<shout>Get the crystal quickly. I'll deal with any Council fool who dares to interrupt."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2546641776" "<shout>See, this is where I steal what I want, and you Council goons leave or die!"
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2017151161" "<shout>This bank is holding an amulet that will bring great power to Lord Recluse. We must get it before the Council does."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1735224810" "<shout>Council dorks, get out of the way. I don't wanna get my armor dirty killing you."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1024556040" "<shout>Lord Recluse hasn't heard of this amulet yet.. I can make some great use of it."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2986541243" "<shout>Neither Quatrexin nor the Council will get their grubby claws on this gem! It's mine, all mine!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Sig_Villain1 Var Name - SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2539872868" "Oh, {HeroName}! It was worth putting up with these Council thugs to kill you!"
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1161294371" "{HeroName}! It was worth working with the Council after all!"
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1141051161" "Yes! Killing you will make all this worthwhile!"
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4082131752" "Predictable, as always {HeroName}. Lord Recluse knew you would come, and I will make you fall."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2959337690" "Ahh, a quick snack before the long trip back. Excellent."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P621004666" "The Desert Wind will scour your flesh from bone."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1159565409" "You're gonna get a chance to die by my latest upgrades, {HeroName}."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3595243897" "You think you can stop me? Think again!"
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P645382209" "Oh no, not you again {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_SG_FF_Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2496969806" "We have reports of an attack by the Council against the Founders Falls bank! The situation is dire, and we need a hero or a team of heroes to <A href={ACCEPT}>head to Founders Falls, and stop that attack!</a> The robbery is in progress, so you won't have more than 5 minutes to thwart the heist before they make an escape. <color red>There are rumors that Arachnos may have loaned the Council one of their elite villains to this mission, so be ready to call for back-up.</color><br><br><color orange>This is a Safeguard mission. Once you prevent the heist, you will have 15 minutes to explore the area and potentially earn extra rewards before the P.P.D. lock down the area. You can earn extra time by defeating vandals and completing side missions, however you can lose time if they destroy too much of the city.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1739506209" "Protect Founders Falls bank"
// SendOffString :
"P2510914175" "The Council and the villain aren't the only problem. Word has it that Crey Industries has decided to test their latest 'Defensive Weaponry' by trying it out during the cover of the attack! The more you stop them, the less of a chance their weapon testing will bear fruit.<br><br><color orange>Periodically, vandals will arrive to destroy parts of the city. You will see a message when they arrive, and their locations will be displayed in your minimap.</color>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2218907359" "Go protect Founders Falls!"
// DeclineString :
"P737905035" "Sorry, can't help you this time."
// DeclineSendOffString :
"P3311727586" "What?! I understand, {HeroName}. You no doubt have some very important things to do. We'll do our best to stop them, but it doesn't look good."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P212804230" "Founders Falls. A bastion of true beauty, marred by the presence of the Crey Corporation lining the streets. The Council are standing at alert at certain locations, while causing a distraction by destroying property in others. You've been tipped off that Arachnos will lead the charge to the bank, so stay alert!"

